cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Clicked Relative Position
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Aesthetic Vulpes
    website: https://github.com/didvc/
repository-code: https://github.com/html-js/clicked-relative-position
url: https://html-js.github.io/clicked-relative-position/
license: AGPL-3.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-31
abstract: >
  A single-page, zero-dependency browser tool that records the position of
  every click relative to a box, in CSS pixels, percent, 0 to 1 fractions or
  device pixels, with a selectable origin. Clicks become numbered, draggable
  marks with undo; a local background image can be measured in its own
  pixels; and the log exports to JSON or CSV with a portable, box-relative
  record per point for placing it again elsewhere. Everything runs locally.
keywords:
  - click-coordinates
  - mouse-position
  - relative-position
  - xy-coordinates
  - image-coordinates
  - pixel-coordinates
  - coordinate-picker
  - percentage-position
  - image-map
  - web-development
